sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant U as Customer/Angular
  participant API as ASP.NET API
  participant P as Policy
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant PUB as Outbox Publisher
  participant K as Kafka
  participant W as Worker
  participant B as External Bank Mock
  U->>API: POST /api/v1/disputes; Idempotency-Key
  API->>API: Authenticate, CSRF, validate, scope owner
  API->>DB: BEGIN, lock/insert idempotency key
  API->>P: Evaluate eligibility with policy version
  P-->>API: Decision and reason
  API->>DB: Insert case + timeline + outbox + response
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  API-->>U: 201 Created, caseStatus=submitted
  loop Until sent
    PUB->>DB: Lease pending outbox rows
    PUB->>K: Publish stable eventId / aggregateId
    K-->>PUB: Broker ACK
    PUB->>DB: Mark published
  end
  K->>W: Receive event (at least once)
  W->>DB: BEGIN; insert processed_messages
  W->>B: Call using stable operation reference
  alt Partner confirms
    B-->>W: Status confirmed
    W->>DB: Update operation + timeline + outbox
  else Partner response unknown
    W->>DB: Mark outcomeUnknown and schedule reconciliation
  end
  W->>DB: COMMIT
